<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Nov 14 -ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Nov 14 -ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $933.6 billion in the week to November 14 from $943.3 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     49.96		46.89</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     23.18		24.83</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  883.67	     896.47</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    162.01	     186.38</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	645.06	     676.34</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    288.56	     267.03</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
